using StateSystem

~ start
Bartender: You again. Same as usual?
- Yeah, the usual. [if StateSystem.hope_despair >= 5]
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": 2})
	=> end
- Not tonight. [if StateSystem.hope_despair <= 3]
	do StateSystem.set_flag("declined_drink", true)
	=> end
- ...
	=> end

~ end
Bartender: See you around.
- ...
	=> END
